{"text": "I need to find 13^10 and then sum its decimal digits.\n\nLet me calculate this step-by-step:\n\n**Step 1: Calculate 13^10**\n\nLet me work through the powers:\n- 13^1 = 13\n- 13^2 = 169\n- 13^3 = 2,197\n- 13^4 = 28,561\n- 13^5 = 371,293\n\nContinuing:\n- 13^6 = 4,826,809\n- 13^7 = 62,748,517\n- 13^8 = 815,730,721\n- 13^9 = 10,604,499,373\n- 13^10 = 137,858,491,849\n\n**Step 2: Sum the decimal digits**\n\nThe digits of 137,858,491,849 are:\n1, 3, 7, 8, 5, 8, 4, 9, 1, 8, 4, 9\n\nSum = 1 + 3 + 7 + 8 + 5 + 8 + 4 + 9 + 1 + 8 + 4 + 9\n    = (1 + 3 + 7 + 8 + 5) + (8 + 4 + 9 + 1 + 8) + (4 + 9)\n    = 24 + 30 + 13\n    = 67\n\n**ANSWER: 67**", "usage": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 933, "output_tokens": 1600, "cost_usd": 0.008933, "latency_s": 13.760164499282837}, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "stop_reason": "end_turn"}